      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Demo: AdHoc filters scoped by Cube view (#307)\n\n**Before the fix:** an AdHoc filter like `order_details.status = completed` was injected into *every* panel query — the Customer directory panel errored (unknown member) and turned red.\n\n**After the fix:** only panels whose query targets the `order_details` view receive that filter. Customer directory keeps working; edit that panel to see the SQL-preview hint about skipped filters."
      }
